      <title>标普500成长股与价值股的52周远期市盈率差值已收窄至仅1.0点，较2022年及2024年逾13点的峰值大幅收缩，创2010年以来最窄水平。市场已不再愿意为成长</title>
      <link>https://t.me/fingraph66/11789</link>
      <description>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;标普500成长股与价值股的52周远期市盈率差值已收窄至仅1.0点，较2022年及2024年逾13点的峰值大幅收缩，创2010年以来最窄水平。市场已不再愿意为成长属性支付额外估值溢价。&lt;br/&gt;来源：Yardeni Research&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/ucwoBp5Z3v-c2jvW3dUavyl65e8dLxfU-O7RG7xyE2lRBEFtnaMwQyIFzl_Yj21WkojWwAAptkIk4CK-OWpOzaljRR0lq9NAHgvX4M9nXpLUI3GMJivE1NrkA7TG5shFRcYWz4INywOIniOureXnL8ByEFuROzzyADgCZQGRuQKZSPseVAiryW1Q3ATIPirxVX8w40nnONpmoGC4sxvaV0IdrL-8LB12SSLOTwdTaxgj6NHmVkPx9vxR9RCnH47dWCgYXotuZDNQ0WoYlatDKB1of_Xc5__Si1oLcklwlDaK2k5-6Ku_oDCFW6Xh5tsYoYSgHM_jCXz9oYNUpIh_KA.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <content:encoded>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;标普500成长股与价值股的52周远期市盈率差值已收窄至仅1.0点，较2022年及2024年逾13点的峰值大幅收缩，创2010年以来最窄水平。市场已不再愿意为成长属性支付额外估值溢价。&lt;br/&gt;来源：Yardeni Research&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/ucwoBp5Z3v-c2jvW3dUavyl65e8dLxfU-O7RG7xyE2lRBEFtnaMwQyIFzl_Yj21WkojWwAAptkIk4CK-OWpOzaljRR0lq9NAHgvX4M9nXpLUI3GMJivE1NrkA7TG5shFRcYWz4INywOIniOureXnL8ByEFuROzzyADgCZQGRuQKZSPseVAiryW1Q3ATIPirxVX8w40nnONpmoGC4sxvaV0IdrL-8LB12SSLOTwdTaxgj6NHmVkPx9vxR9RCnH47dWCgYXotuZDNQ0WoYlatDKB1of_Xc5__Si1oLcklwlDaK2k5-6Ku_oDCFW6Xh5tsYoYSgHM_jCXz9oYNUpIh_KA.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded>
