    <item>
      <title>自2022年底ChatGPT发布开启人工智能热潮以来，标普500指数的市盈率目前已较峰值回撤21%，跨过20%的象征性“估值熊市”门槛；但同期成分股的每股收益仍</title>
      <link>https://t.me/fingraph66/11788</link>
      <description>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;自2022年底ChatGPT发布开启人工智能热潮以来，标普500指数的市盈率目前已较峰值回撤21%，跨过20%的象征性“估值熊市”门槛；但同期成分股的每股收益仍维持在历史高位，尚未出现回撤。相比之下，互联网泡沫破裂时期，两项指标曾分别较峰值回撤37%和15%。&lt;br/&gt;来源：百达资产管理&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/W0iwJDsLINHSgPHP0lo6pW_B5yqN5jwkss1GcfnY88HZwaiBTwE2HmqcsWUTGYo3VvjMYRYxKSmhu2MT8hTCx5fKWM83jB11UH35eIFxg30c7Ykeo6VVPL-JsAu5I-9yQulmN4xB5YC81djUvfDd63UXA8OV20gf8d7UI5fELlpy86eivz_ln4m5TRBJrVC7tiY_HtR9tsRvFhxEVaIMS1T4r8lJpKdmJxsQ2MpEIXNMGp_NUjqesBLfy7xYy3mRHPMCrhuT6h9tGY0wimfOvn9dmuYs2tDdmJIkLyOQAr1u-NzSCkYNgQvCGvZ-nfE2Fv20L665qx710CJYeoAATA.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
      <content:encoded>&lt;div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"&gt;自2022年底ChatGPT发布开启人工智能热潮以来，标普500指数的市盈率目前已较峰值回撤21%，跨过20%的象征性“估值熊市”门槛；但同期成分股的每股收益仍维持在历史高位，尚未出现回撤。相比之下，互联网泡沫破裂时期，两项指标曾分别较峰值回撤37%和15%。&lt;br/&gt;来源：百达资产管理&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/W0iwJDsLINHSgPHP0lo6pW_B5yqN5jwkss1GcfnY88HZwaiBTwE2HmqcsWUTGYo3VvjMYRYxKSmhu2MT8hTCx5fKWM83jB11UH35eIFxg30c7Ykeo6VVPL-JsAu5I-9yQulmN4xB5YC81djUvfDd63UXA8OV20gf8d7UI5fELlpy86eivz_ln4m5TRBJrVC7tiY_HtR9tsRvFhxEVaIMS1T4r8lJpKdmJxsQ2MpEIXNMGp_NUjqesBLfy7xYy3mRHPMCrhuT6h9tGY0wimfOvn9dmuYs2tDdmJIkLyOQAr1u-NzSCkYNgQvCGvZ-nfE2Fv20L665qx710CJYeoAATA.jpg" alt="Telegram post image" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" /&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</content:encoded>
